{"content":[{"c":["LAHMI"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Brother of Goliath the Gittite. According to ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.20.5","r":"1Chr.20.5","rawR":"1Chr.20.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.20.5","value":"1Chr.20.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 20:5"},", he was killed by Elhanan. However, ",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.21.19","r":"2Sam.21.19","rawR":"2Sam.21.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.21.19","value":"2Sam.21.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Samuel 21:19"}," says that Elhanan killed Goliath rather than his brother Lahmi. Most interpreters accept the 1 Chronicles passage as the correct reading, the 2 Samuel text being a textual corruption."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Lahmi","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 20:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.20.5","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.20.5","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.20.5"},{"anchorText":"2 Samuel 21:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.21.19","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.21.19","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.21.19"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"97e32eab7d7c4cc6d86b8ca1417680ff336ba0bce4e4e9544e744e767d6a0332","sourceItemName":"Lahmi","sourceItemOrder":12,"sourceMember":"Articles/L.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Lahmi","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Lahmi","title":"Lahmi","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}